!!! oculus/window-identity.mat
!!! Unique generational identifiers for windows and scene elements.
!!!
!!! An identity is a nonzero, nonwrapping counter value. The book
!!! provides a fresh identity source and identity equality checking.

book oculus.window.identity

read everything from ny.lang.core

public variable identity-counter as override long is 1

fresh-identity returns override long begin paragraph
    set identity-counter to (identity-counter plus 1)
    give identity-counter
end paragraph
